# Keep the image build context small and free of runtime data.
# The deploy directory accumulates state (MinIO artifacts, release mirrors,
# SWAG config) that COPY . . would otherwise bake into the images — this
# grew the build context to ~800 MB and deploy times from ~80 s to >45 min.
.git
.gitignore
config
data
minio-data
iqm-releases-mirror
openapi-docs
static
.env
.env.dev
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv
venv
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
*.egg-info
build
dist
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
docs
minio-data*
